                    <i class="bi bi-megaphone-fill"></i> Broadcast Massal
                </h3>
                <div class="bg-red-500/10 border border-red-500/20 rounded-xl p-3 mb-4">
                    <p class="text-[9px] font-black text-red-400 uppercase leading-relaxed">
                        <i class="bi bi-exclamation-triangle-fill"></i> Hati-hati! Pesan ini akan dikirim ke <strong>SEMUA</strong> pelanggan aktif.
                    </p>
                </div>
